# Troubleshooting Checklist — Basic PC & Connectivity

Use this short checklist when a user reports a computer or network issue.

1. Gather details: what happened, when, and any error messages  
2. Reproduce the issue (with permission)  
3. Check cables, power, Wi-Fi connection  
4. Restart the app, browser, or PC  
5. Verify network (ping 8.8.8.8)  
6. Check for OS or driver updates  
7. Document steps taken and results  
8. If unresolved, escalate with logs or screenshots
